format: 3
name: a ledger fromPlutusData of Data its decoder refuses
class: Case
method: m
arg: d87b80
expect: DIVERGE M5 Failure/Value
jvm: Failure []
uplc: Value d87a80 []
note: The reference reads a ledger type's fromPlutusData as an identity, so Data the JVM's decoder refuses passes. Closed by M5.
